# Generated artifacts must be byte-identical on every machine.
#
# The plugin ships `lib/` in its npm tarball, and the release workflow rebuilds
# the same bundle on a Linux checkout. With `core.autocrlf=true` on Windows the
# working tree holds CRLF while a Linux checkout holds LF, so the same sources
# would produce two different bundles. Pinning LF keeps every checkout in
# agreement, and `build.mjs` normalises its output as well.
* text=auto eol=lf
